{"id":"2becd86e100bd483","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-booleq.md","title":"Boolean equation","display":"df-booleq — Boolean equation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-booleq","aliases":["27-df-booleq"],"display":"df-booleq — Boolean equation","depends_on":["[[27-df-boolfunc]]"],"local_review_status":"formally-reviewed-2026-10-20; source-not-rechecked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-booleq"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-booleq</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-booleq — Boolean equation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5d10aed668d85817\" href=\"?note=5d10aed668d85817\" title=\"27-df-boolfunc\">27-df-boolfunc</a></span></div>"},{"key":"local_review_status","html":"formally-reviewed-2026-10-20; source-not-rechecked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，固定本文件各函数、项及关系的元数。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\">\\(f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathbb{B}^{n}\">\\(x\\in\\mathbb{B}^{n}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BooleanEq}\\subseteq\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\times\\mathbb{B}^{n}\">\\(\\mathrm{BooleanEq}\\subseteq\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\times\\mathbb{B}^{n}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BooleanEq}(f,x)\\leftrightarrow f(x)=0\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{BooleanEq}(f,x)\\leftrightarrow f(x)=0\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> solves the equation exactly when <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathrm{Sol}(f)\">\\(x\\in\\mathrm{Sol}(f)\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-boolfunc","status":"resolved","id":"5d10aed668d85817","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-boolfunc]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\mathbb{B}^{n}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BooleanEq}\\subseteq\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\times\\mathbb{B}^{n}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BooleanEq}(f,x)\\leftrightarrow f(x)=0","display":true},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\mathrm{Sol}(f)","display":false}],"bytes":697,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-163","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-df-booleq|df-booleq — Boolean equation]]"}],"outgoing":["5d10aed668d85817"]}